  "description": "CLI tool to package .NET MAUI Linux (OpenMaui) apps as AppImages or Flatpaks. One command from csproj to AppImage: openmaui-appimage --project ./MyApp. Includes host-dependency checks, zsync self-update, GPG signing, and AppStream metadata. Full usage guide (written for humans and AI assistants): https://github.com/open-maui/appimage/blob/main/docs/PACKAGING-GUIDE.md",
